%% Main Responsibility: Header extraction pipeline (text → parse → validate).
%% Product Flow B still owns upload/review/approve; this diagram is the PROCESSING step.
%% Sync in POST /documents and POST /documents/{id}/process. Line items stay out of DB/UI.

flowchart TD
  start([PROCESSING starts]) --> mime{MIME type?}

  mime -->|application/pdf| pdfbox[PDFBox text layer]
  pdfbox --> usable{Usable digital text?}
  usable -->|yes| textSrc[OcrResult text]
  usable -->|no| raster[Rasterize pages to PNG]
  raster --> ocr

  mime -->|image/jpeg or png| img[Image bytes]
  img --> ocr[OCR sidecar]

  ocr --> textSrc
  textSrc --> blank{Non-blank text?}
  blank -->|no| failed[PROCESSING_FAILED]
  blank -->|yes| parse[ReceiptParser LLM on text only]
  parse --> validate[Java ExtractionValidator<br/>EUR · date · amount · category]
  validate --> header{Any usable header?}
  header -->|yes| review[REVIEW_REQUIRED]
  header -->|no| failed

  review --> human[User edits and approve]
  failed --> recover[Retry · continue-manual · or delete]
